# Local Claude Code / assistant tooling. Vendored third-party skill packs live
# here under their own licences (Apache-2.0, GPL-3.0, source-available); this
# repository is MIT and must not appear to relicense them.
#
# Three files here are ours and ship as a product surface: the PreToolUse
# enforcement hook (tsup builds dist/hook-catch.mjs for it, see tsup.config.ts),
# its tests, and the settings.json that wires it. Those stay tracked.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/wp-enforce.cjs
!.claude/hooks/__tests__/
.claude/hooks/__tests__/*
!.claude/hooks/__tests__/wp-enforce.test.cjs
CLAUDE.md

# Wires any checkout of this repo to the paid hosted MCP. Not a project default.
.mcp.json

# Internal planning scaffold; the real docs are archived outside the repo.
plans/
